      "mergedPostDetails": "If you press a key like W and then tab out of VRChat window, the game thinks you are still pressing it.\n**Repro steps:**\n1. Hold down on W, or any other button for movement.\n2. Press the Windows key, or use Alt + Tab to tab out of the VRChat window.\nIf you do this, you will notice that you are continuing to move forward. This is not the case in live currently.",
