  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "For instance, repro step is:\n1. Run VRChat.exe in desktop mode \n2. Press `Shift` key and continue to pressing\n3. Type `Alt + Tab` and change active window to some other app\n4. Stop pressing `Shift` key\n5. Type `Alt + Tab` and activate VRChat window again\n6. Type `ESC` key, then the safe mode is activated. Though the safe mode is bound to `Shift + ESC` and you don't press `Shift` key.\n\nAll key inputs seems behave as same. for example if you try `W` then the avatar continues to walk forward.",
